{"unit_id":"xiong356__dsh-draft-optimizer#feature-1","repo":"xiong356/dsh-draft-optimizer","commit":"495ec79732e91f4e5eb8ee8929bda2352f039542","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Draft Optimizer 的功能「一键改写草稿」：在对话输入框或新建对话界面点击按钮，插件调用当前默认模型生成优化后的提示词，并将文本返回给界面。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:247-250","lib/index.js:135-158"]}
